- Me as an artist,
like, when I'm on stage,

00:08:16.275 --> 00:08:17.972
it's not just me performing,

00:08:17.972 --> 00:08:20.041
and people just singing the song with me.

00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:21.598
There's also like fan chants,

00:08:21.598 --> 00:08:23.219
and this whole other fan culture

00:08:23.219 --> 00:08:25.822
that's extremely dedicated to that artist.

00:08:25.822 --> 00:08:27.326
- You look amazing.

00:08:27.326 --> 00:08:29.022
(people murmuring)

00:08:29.022 --> 00:08:32.522
(applauding and cheering)

00:08:40.403 --> 00:08:42.489
(cheering)

00:08:42.489 --> 00:08:44.628
- (laughs)

00:08:44.628 --> 00:08:45.477
- [Steven] What's up, man?

00:08:45.477 --> 00:08:46.640
- Look at you.

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.293
You look so cool. (laughs)

00:08:48.293 --> 00:08:49.126
- [Steven] Thank you.

00:08:49.126 --> 00:08:49.959
This is it.

00:08:49.959 --> 00:08:51.371
All my training, all my hard work,

00:08:51.371 --> 00:08:54.155
this entire week has led
up to this one moment.

00:08:54.155 --> 00:08:55.686
Here goes nothing.

00:08:55.686 --> 00:08:57.103
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:08:59.846 --> 00:09:01.275
(singing in a foreign language)

00:09:01.275 --> 00:09:02.929
(clapping)

00:09:02.929 --> 00:09:05.926
(hip hop music)

00:09:05.926 --> 00:09:07.600
♫ But I'm killing it

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.731
♫ Hold up

00:09:08.731 --> 00:09:10.406
♫ Girl feel crazy ♫

00:09:10.406 --> 00:09:11.963
(singing in a foreign language)

00:09:11.963 --> 00:09:13.840
This is the craziest week of my life.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.304
Emotionally, I would be so high sometimes,

00:09:16.304 --> 00:09:18.182
just like, oh, I finally
got this dance move down.

00:09:18.182 --> 00:09:19.675
And then the next hour,

00:09:19.675 --> 00:09:22.672
I would be like devastated
because I just couldn't

00:09:22.672 --> 00:09:23.739
nail a certain note

00:09:23.739 --> 00:09:24.572
♫ And then you say

00:09:24.572 --> 00:09:26.107
♫ No, no, no ♫

00:09:26.107 --> 00:09:27.611
(singing in a foreign language)

00:09:27.611 --> 00:09:29.542
♫ Party ♫

00:09:29.542 --> 00:09:31.558
At the end of this, can
I become a Kpop star?

00:09:31.558 --> 00:09:32.400
There's no way.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.512
I was so tired, so hungry.

00:09:34.512 --> 00:09:37.040
I lost all connection
with the outside world.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:41.632
♫ Baby, you and me ♫

00:09:41.632 --> 00:09:43.051
(singing in a foreign language)

00:09:43.051 --> 00:09:44.038
And the fact that, like,

00:09:44.038 --> 00:09:45.990
all of this will probably lead nowhere.

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:47.846
- Sounds like what you
went through emotionally

00:09:47.846 --> 00:09:49.841
is exactly what all these
trainees go through.

00:09:49.841 --> 00:09:51.025
You only had a week.

00:09:51.025 --> 00:09:52.348
Don't be too hard on yourself.

00:09:52.348 --> 00:09:54.491
Good job actually getting a video out.

00:09:54.491 --> 00:09:56.134
A lot of trainees don't have that.

00:09:56.134 --> 00:09:56.967
- Really?

00:09:56.967 --> 00:09:57.800
- Yeah, good work.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:58.758
- Thank you very much.

00:09:58.758 --> 00:10:00.647
(singing in a foreign language)

00:10:00.647 --> 00:10:03.314
(hip hop music)

00:10:12.156 --> 00:10:13.532
- If you don't know Kpop, love Kpop,

00:10:13.532 --> 00:10:14.546
or get to know Kpop.

00:10:14.546 --> 00:10:18.607
It's awesome, Kpop, Kpop. (laughs)

